; FBX 7.4.0 project file
; Hand-written test for Rostrum3D's FBX import (convert_fbx_anim.cpp): no outside content.
; "Bar": a 0.2 x 2 x 0.2 m column of 12 points, skinned to Bone1 (bottom ring), Bone1+Bone2 half and half (middle
; ring) and Bone2 (top ring). Bone2 (at y = 1) turns about Z: 0 deg at 0 s, 60 deg at 0.5 s, 30 deg at 1 s.
; "Spinner": a plain 0.3 m cube, not skinned; it slides x 1 -> 2 m and turns 0 -> 180 deg about Y over 1 s.
; Cluster Transform = the mesh node -> bone at bind (inverse of the bone's bind for a mesh at the origin), as exporters write it.
; Y up, metres (UnitScaleFactor 100 = 100 cm per unit). 1 s = 46186158000 FBX time ticks.
